{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"concept_hrm","type":"text","text":"### 🧠 Hierarchical Reasoning Model (HRM)\n- **Multi-Timescale Architecture**: Nested recurrent loops\n- **High-Level Planner ($z_H$)**: Operates slowly on abstract plans\n- **Low-Level Executor ($z_L$)**: Operates rapidly on detail steps\n- **Deep Algorithmic Thinking**: Multi-step forward pass without verbose chain-of-thought token emission","x":-450,"y":180,"width":400,"height":360,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"problem_memory_wall","type":"text","text":"### 🛑 The Memory Wall & Scale Bottleneck\n- **2.78 Trillion Parameters** = 5.56 TB in standard BF16\n- **O(T²) Quadratic Attention**: Standard KV cache grows linearly with context, blowing past consumer VRAM/DRAM\n- **Wall is Capacity, Not Compute**: Waiting for faster GPUs doesn't fix models that physically exceed RAM","x":-1280,"y":-570,"width":380,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"reduction_cascade","type":"text","text":"### 📉 The Four Memory Reductions\n- **5,560 GB** (Baseline BF16)\n  ⬇️ *Reduction 1: MXFP4 Quantization*\n- **1,560 GB** (Shipped Checkpoint: 0.53B/param)\n  ⬇️ *Reduction 2: MoE Dynamic Routing (16 of 896 experts)*\n- **113.49 GB** (Always-Active Dense Trunk)\n  ⬇️ *Reduction 3 & 4: KDA/MLA + O_DIRECT NVMe Streaming*\n- **8.24 GB** (Measured Peak RSS on 1 CPU, 0 GPUs)\n\n**Total: 675× Memory Reduction with Byte-Identical Output**","x":-780,"y":-340,"width":420,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"concept_kda","type":"text","text":"### 🔁 KDA: Kimi Delta Attention\n- **69 of 93 layers** in Kimi K3\n- **Recurrent Linear Attention**: Constant $O(1)$ memory footprint\n- **Input-Dependent Decay Gate**: Bounded by $\\text{gate\\_lb} = -5.0$\n- **Depthwise 1D Causal Conv**: $k=4$, SiLU fused\n- **KV Cache Never Grows**: Eliminates sequence length memory scaling!","x":40,"y":-675,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"concept_mla","type":"text","text":"### 🎯 MLA: Multi-Head Latent Attention\n- **24 of 93 layers** (Global attention checkpoints)\n- **Latent Low-Rank KV Compression**: Compresses 96 attention heads into a single 512-dim latent vector\n- **NoPE Mechanism**: Rotary position embedding bypassed on 64 dimensions while maintaining head slot geometry\n- **Dramatic Bandwidth Reduction** during autoregressive decode","x":40,"y":-370,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"concept_moe","type":"text","text":"### 🔀 Block-Sparse Mixture of Experts (MoE)\n- **896 Routed Experts** + **2 Resident Shared Experts**\n- **Top-16 Sparse Activation**: Only 3.7% of parameters active per token; 96.3% remain asleep on disk\n- **1.447 TB of Experts** streamed directly on-demand\n- **Unbiased Sigmoid Scoring**: Router bias steers expert selection only; combination preserves unskewed weights","x":40,"y":-100,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"concept_systems_c","type":"text","text":"### ⚙️ Systems Engineering & Bare-Metal C/C++\n- **Zero-Allocation Arena**: 64-byte cache line aligned bump arena; zero runtime `malloc` during passes\n- **Direct I/O (`O_DIRECT`)**: Bypasses OS page cache, achieving 5.9 GB/s NVMe throughput\n- **Bit-Identical Contract (`-ffp-contract=off`)**: Enforces bit-for-bit equivalence across scalar, OpenMP, and AVX2\n- **176 KB Engine Binary**: Zero external framework dependencies","x":820,"y":-220,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"concept_act","type":"text","text":"### ⏱️ Adaptive Computation Time (ACT)\n- **Learned $Q$-Head Halting**: $q = [q_{\\text{halt}}, q_{\\text{continue}}]$\n- **Dynamic Compute Allocation**: Simple queries exit at Step 1; complex puzzles iterate up to $R_{\\text{max}}$\n- **Softmax Confidence Threshold**: Terminates iteration when $p_{\\text{halt}} \\ge \\tau$\n- **Saves Up to 80% Compute** in production inference","x":300,"y":310,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"concept_agentic_kg","type":"text","text":"### 🕸️ Agentic Knowledge Graph & Non-Parametric Grounding\n- **Structured Curated Edges Over Model Extraction**: Avoids costly LLM extraction ($33k GraphRAG indexing) by parsing structured metadata (PubMed/MeSH)\n- **Zero-Hallucination Grounding**: Longest-match entity lookup directly onto graph entry points\n- **Verifiable Traversal**: Agent walks explicit knowledge paths, cites graph triples, and refuses when no valid path exists","x":-1260,"y":160,"width":400,"height":380,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"edge_wall_to_reductions","fromNode":"problem_memory_wall","fromSide":"right","toNode":"reduction_cascade","toSide":"left","label":"SOLVED BY"},
